  "description": "Yeon-woo and her family of three live in an old, low-rise apartment building on the outskirts of Seoul.\nHer mother is always busy with work at a restaurant, and her older brother, a high school senior, is on edge preparing for the college entrance exam.\nTo make matters worse, even her one and only best friend moves away, leaving Yeon-woo feeling like a loner.\n\nThen one day, she meets a friend in her dreams who looks exactly like her—a girl named Maeum (Heart).\nFrom that moment, Yeon-woo's life begins to change little by little.\nShe becomes friends with Sol-i, who lives in the same building but was always awkward with her, and she starts opening her heart to neighbors she once viewed with prejudice.\n\n*Source: Kakao Page*\n\n**Original Webtoon:**    \n[KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/69217112), [Daum](https://webtoon.kakao.com/content/%EB%A7%88%EC%9D%8C-%EB%B0%94%EB%8B%A4/4852)",
